cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the benchmark paper and the dataset (separate DOIs)."
title: "EvEMTBench Benchmark: evaluation software for machine learning in power system protection"
abstract: >-
  The executable and versioned evaluation component of EvEMTBench: task definitions, valid-sample
  rules, observability views, committed partitions, leakage controls, metrics, reference baselines
  and reference results for machine-learning-based power system protection on simulated
  electromagnetic-transient (EMT) waveforms of four grids (20-345 kV).
